{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/538333-mage-the-awakening-themed-tarot-deck","id":538333,"title":"Mage the Awakening Themed Tarot Deck","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-06-03T08:00:33-07:00","id":538333,"title":"Mage the Awakening Themed Tarot Deck","content":"Is something like that available for purchase? If not, are there any plans for a deck?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5092-quazar87","name":"Quazar87","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5092_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-03T08:05:16-07:00","id":538371,"title":"","content":"There was at one point, but I don't know if it's still in print. There's also an accompanying book Keys to the Supernal Tarot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-03T08:14:46-07:00","id":538381,"title":"","content":"Yeah - there is/was one, but it's out of print. And currently on Amazon for 180-ish dollars.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.amazon.com/Mage-the-Awakening-Tarot/dp/1588463710\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.amazon.com/Mage-the-Awakening-Tarot/dp/1588463710\" target=\"_blank\"> Amazon.com </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.amazon.com/Mage-the-Awakening-Tarot/dp/1588463710\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.amazon.com/Mage-the-Awakening-Tarot/dp/1588463710 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-03T08:19:12-07:00","id":538384,"title":"","content":"This is one of my prized possessions - it's genuinely a stunningly beautiful tarot deck. If you can pick it up for less than those crazy prices, it's worth getting hold of.<br /> <br /> Dave - could we possibly get a version via POD? It could be a great way to revive the deck, and I know a number of people who are envious of my copy. The cards from DTRPG are very good.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/33-nifara","name":"Nifara","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar33_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"38"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-03T08:23:32-07:00","id":538388,"title":"","content":"I knew it was going to go out of print, so I bought it when I could. I use them all the time, they really are quite gorgeous, and it comes with a little book that has ideas on how to use them.<br /> <br /> As for POD, I don't think so. The current card printer they have prints sizes smaller than the original deck, and believe me, that size is ideal. They'd probably have to go to a custom printer for that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-03T08:27:08-07:00","id":538391,"title":"","content":"Funnily enough, I was after the very same thing about three days ago. However, I was put off by the price gouging of sellers (try finding WoD dice for less than 100$s). I did find this though, <a href=\"http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ISBN=0738715794/ref=nosim/aeclectic/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/IS...sim/aeclectic/</a><br /> <br /> Its a tarot deck whose art is by Stephanie Pui-Mun Law, the artist who did a number of pieces for Changeling the Lost. It also only cost 25$ and looks rather beautiful in an ethereal/fae manner <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5439,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5439-gullinbursti","user":"Gullinbursti","date":". 06-03-2015, 12:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5439-gullinbursti","name":"Gullinbursti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5439_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"291"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-03T08:46:24-07:00","id":538420,"title":"","content":"I'm using mine <a href=\"http://www.luisroyofantasy.com/cards/the-labyrinth-tarot/\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Luis Royo's <i>Labirynth Tarot</i></b></a>, and beside the official Awakening Deck, I think it's best one to used in <b>Mage</b> - it has this very profund smbology in it. And even Minor Arcana have a great vibe - also, they make my and mine players to rember about basic Path Tools like Cups, Pentacle or Wands. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Here are some samples from it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://www.amigra.pl/_var/gfx/3cf862441551c2a01b2597e3914ef21b.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://www.amigra.pl/_var/gfx/cca02a1783e43aeaff48df47449eacaa.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 06-03-2015, 11:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-06T23:28:41-07:00","id":543508,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gullinbursti</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/538333-mage-the-awakening-themed-tarot-deck?p=538391#post538391\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Funnily enough, I was after the very same thing about three days ago. However, I was put off by the price gouging of sellers (try finding WoD dice for less than 100$s). I did find this though, <a href=\"https://&amp;quot;http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ISBN=0738715794/ref=nosim/aeclectic/&amp;quot;\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/IS...sim/aeclectic/</a><br /> <br /> Its a tarot deck whose art is by Stephanie Pui-Mun Law, the artist who did a number of pieces for Changeling the Lost. It also only cost 25$ and looks rather beautiful in an ethereal/fae manner <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Regarding the WoD dice -- seriously? My local hobby shop carries all of the sets. I probably have 50-60 of the things myself, between having played oWerewolf, oVampire, and nMage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1446-raikirah","name":"Raikirah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1446_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","va